<file path="docs/owners/account.md">
# Account

The narrow `readUserDeliveryTarget` PostgreSQL query returns only a currently active User's binding for the requested provider. Notifications owns target snapshots and delivery state; LINE owns provider protocol.

Read this file for the Account owner boundary and invariants. Load [detailed reference](../reference/domains/account.md) only for lifecycle / command / locator / policy details.

## Current responsibility

Account/User 是 current human registration、restore、qualification、optional external identity link confirmation 與 management owner。User lifecycle 使用 `active | paused | suspended`。`Member` 不再是 current identity/domain 名稱；舊 membership routes 與歷史 protocol/payload 只在其既有 owner boundary 需要時保留，不建立第二套 Domain model。

DailyCheckIn 擁有 business-day/reward policy、use case/query 與 atomic claim；Account 只提供 User qualification/lifecycle 與 Account-owned User projection。既有 `/api/membership` 的 default Account + Coin read projection由 Web delivery composition 組合 DailyCheckIn query，不進入 Account application contract；Account Settings 使用 `view=account` 只讀 Account projection，DailyCheckIn UI/recovery 不再由 Account Web module 承擔。External provider verification 屬 Integration/Security；Asset denomination、Wallet balance、Ledger history 各有自己的 owner。

Global User／Organization login 的驗證、綁定、解析與改名由 [Namespace](namespace.md) 集中管理。Account 在原有註冊／資格交易內呼叫 Namespace；Profile 不持有第二套 login lifecycle。

User management suspension/unsuspension uses a Contracts input capability and transaction output Port. Command normalization lives in `application/commands/user-status.ts` and is published through the existing `application/manage-users` entry. Application coordinates current IdentityAccess authority before replay, Domain receives only action/version facts to decide the status transition and its event, and the output Port receives the target and replay/audit evidence. PostgreSQL preserves governance/User locks and atomic status/receipt/event persistence. Authority is rechecked after the status write. The public `PostgresUserManagement` entry assembles these dependencies without changing existing constructor or prototype methods.

Registration, restoration, login rename and optional Google binding follow the same ownership split. Application coordinates locked current facts, Domain decides lifecycle/link transitions and event intent, and persistence saves the User, Namespace binding, identity links and events in the existing transaction. Google confirmation reuses the binding use case with a transaction-scoped Port assembled by Composition; it does not create another Store inside the SQL adapter. Public `PostgresUserStore` and `PostgresGoogleLinkStore` constructors and prototype methods remain stable.

Follow/Unfollow writes recheck current User qualification in the relationship transaction, under the shared governance protocol and User row locks. Domain owns self-follow and followable-target decisions. A prior application read does not authorize a write after qualification is lost; lifecycle pause preserves existing relationships.

Profile field validity, public visibility and version/exact-retry decisions belong to Domain. Application keeps command decoding and projection; the existing Repository implements the locked qualification and atomic save predicates without a separate transaction Port.

Authored Profile status is distinct from User qualification and provider status. Account owns its public-only message, emoji, availability and expiry, with Organization-scoped audience currently unsupported. Application coordinates current qualification, exact replay, Domain version decisions and atomic persistence through a transaction output Port. Clearing preserves the durable version; public reads omit cleared, expired and inactive-user status. A historical command receipt does not replace a current-state read for presentation.

## Invariants

User state 是 current human qualification authority。LINE `destination` 是 Integration 的 signed provider metadata，不是 Account identity 或 business authorization。External link 不轉移歷史 ownership；每個 private request 重新核驗 qualification/permission/scope。Receipt 不作永久授權，Account 不保存可寫 Coin balance，也不修改 Ledger entries。

## Adjacent owners

- Account identity rules are defined by this owner contract, source and tests.
- [DailyCheckIn rules](daily-check-in.md)
- [Asset](asset.md) · [Wallet](wallet.md) · [Ledger](ledger.md)
- [External identity mapping](../reference/data/identity-mapping.md)
- [LINE identity verification](line-integration.md)
- [Feature permissions](../reference/security/permissions.md)
- [Namespace](namespace.md)
</file>

<file path="docs/owners/actions.md">
# Actions
Actions owns two fixed Project business automations: manual checks of a specified WBS Revision, and explicit-recipient notifications after WBS Baseline publication. WBS owns scope facts and publication events; Notifications owns Inbox and LINE delivery; Project owns current access/lifecycle; Account owns identity and active-User qualification. GitHub SCM/CI Workflow remains separate.

R1 retains the implemented Repository-scoped automation path only to transfer and verify existing durable state. It is not a second final product model: new Project automation uses `project_action_*`, and removal of the Repository path requires verified transfer/readback rather than permanent dual writes.

Domain owns manual-run eligibility, event admission, Run initialization, expected-version checks and step transitions. Application coordinates commands using a transaction output Port; Aggregate Repository contracts expose rule/run load/save with expected version. Worker acceptance, claim, inspection and fenced completion are output capabilities, not Aggregate Repository operations. Published rule/run DTOs project an explicit field set and detach nested recipient/results state from Domain models.

Rule creation/update/enable/disable and manual execute/retry/cancel require current Project `ADMIN` and an open Project. Commands use request identity and expected version with durable exact replay. Enabling establishes a qualification-version-bound delegation and captures the current Project WBS event cursor; re-enabling only admits newer events. Updating an enabled definition retains its delegation when the same qualified delegate updates it. Definition versions are immutable. Closed Projects allow reads and exact replay only; deleted Projects are not found.

First event acceptance atomically fixes every matching rule version and recipient list, including no matching rule. Redelivery cannot add newly created rules or change recipients. Acceptance commits before WBS acknowledge. Each Run has durable attempts, progress and a lease; expired workers cannot save results. The bounded worker claims one event or executes one fixed step per budget unit. It rechecks current delegate qualification/version, Project `ADMIN`, open lifecycle, enabled generation and its live lease before initiating a step.

Checks return WBS findings without granting approval or publishing a Baseline. Notification results distinguish Inbox creation, provider acceptance, unavailability, failure and uncertainty; Run completion means the fixed steps finished, not device delivery. Retry resumes the same step/intent/provider key. Cancellation stops future steps, repeats idempotent intent suppression on command replay, and preserves prior effects. A request already initiated at the cancellation boundary may have an uncertain external outcome.

Delivery recovery is Notifications-owned: target/payload/retry key persist before attempting, current binding and recipient eligibility are rechecked, retries back off and stop before 23 hours. No arbitrary scripts, schedule builder, generic graph engine or automatic subscription fan-out.

Validation: owner unit/persistence tests, disposable PostgreSQL concurrency, mock LINE, schema/architecture/docs checks, repository check/validate and exact-head CI. Internal entries are [documented here](../../scripts/README.md). Production worker enablement and real LINE recipient/device evidence are separate.
</file>

<file path="docs/owners/attendance.md">
# Attendance

Read this file for the Attendance owner boundary and invariants. Load [detailed reference](../reference/domains/attendance.md) only for lifecycle / command / locator / policy details.

## Responsibility

Attendance owns clock-in / clock-out、open session invariant、time classification、Repository-point eligibility、clock reward eligibility / amount、supplement requests/reviews、write replay/version 與 attendance-derived menu/notification expectations。Asset denomination、Wallet balance 與 durable Ledger history 由各自 owner 定義；LINE delivery、LIFF runtime 與 deployment 不屬本 module business authority。

## Session invariants

- 同一 current User 最多一筆未結束 session。
- Session 不重疊，end 不早於 start；同日可以多次 clock-in/out。
- Server 保存 UTC time point；display / business day 使用 Asia/Taipei。
- 跨日 session 只是一筆 session；按每日實際相交時間分類，不重複累計。
- 未結束 session 只顯示截至 query `computedAt` 的暫計。

## Command safety

Write command 帶 stable request UUID、`expectedVersion` 與定位 payload。Actor / server time 由 server 決定。

- Version conflict → 拒絕，不覆寫新狀態。
- Same request ID + same command → 回 durable receipt，不重複 session、Ledger credit、event 或 notification。
- Same request ID + different content → conflict。
- Transaction 內重新核驗 current User qualification 與 Repository-address eligibility。
- Session state、version、event、Ledger credit、receipt 與必要 outbox expectation 同 transaction commit/rollback；value persistence 不拆成遠端 service call。

Browser `sessionStorage` 只能協助 UX 恢復；server receipt/version/state 才是 authority。

## Supplement requests

- User 只能提出補登，不可直接建立或改寫 Attendance session。
- MVP 支援兩種提案：新增一段完整的已結束歷史 session；或替自己的未結束 Repository session 提出下班時間。第二種核准只做單向 close，不改上班時間、Repository 或地址快照。
- 補登地點取自申請時保存的 Repository point snapshot（含可為 null 的描述）；它是申請與人工審核內容，不代表系統驗證了歷史 GPS 位置。
- Repository 當下有效的 `ADMIN` User 才能看到待審核項目並核准／拒絕。Organization-owned Repository 的有效 OrganizationOwner 由 Repository effective access 投影取得隱含 `ADMIN`；決策時仍重新驗證，申請者不得審核自己。
- 申請人不能核准自己的補登。拒絕必須記錄理由；每一決定重驗當下 Repository permission、stable command identity 與 request version。
- 核准建立/結束出勤事實、追加事件、更新版本、留下審核者與更新必要 menu state 同 transaction commit/rollback。拒絕只結束 request 並追加事件。
- 補登不發 Ledger 打卡獎勵，也不計算薪資；正式薪資由後續範圍處理。

審核回應與重試只公開最小操作收據；資格與資料揭露規則見 [Supplement review](../reference/domains/attendance.md#supplement-review)。本人提交申請的完整收據與 clock-out 原始快照契約維持。

## Qualification

- Account/User 提供 current active human qualification，每次操作重新驗證。
- 上班以 Repository 座標與半徑作打卡點；描述地址可為 null，不參與資格判定。仍須有 current effective access；公開可見或 Star 不授權。
- 核驗以打卡當下座標、GPS 精度與半徑計算；地址文字只供辨識，不替代定位證據。
- 下班使用該筆出勤的原始 point snapshot。移除成員、移除或修改 Repository 打卡點不阻擋本人正常下班，但不授予新上班資格。
- Repository 擁有座標、半徑、可選描述與打卡點維護授權；Attendance 擁有出勤、定位核驗、快照與結果。
- 舊 Workplace 管理 API、Web 與 LINE 聊天建立流程已移除。原表只保留歷史資料，runtime 不再讀寫；不得由舊名單推導 Repository access。
</file>

